+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-45-78.</span> Refund of overpayments.<br /><br />
+	If a homestead exemption is granted pursuant to Section 12-37-250 or a residential classification is made pursuant to Section 12-43-220(c) after payment of the property tax for that year, a resulting overpayment must be refunded to the owner of record at the time the exemption is granted or the classification is made.<br /><br />
